      "summary": "Fewer than 95% of jobs with a deadline are meeting it.",
      "description": "\u00a77.1 promises the AI summary is ready before the patient reaches the consultation room, and \u00a78.5 says that promise is measured rather than asserted. This is the measurement. The gauge is absent rather than zero when nothing finished, so a quiet night does not fire this \u2014 which is why the condition is a floor on attainment rather than a ceiling on misses.",
      "runbook": "Look at the queue-health page for which kind. If depth and age are also high the queue is behind and the fix is capacity; if depth is low and attainment is still poor, the work itself has slowed down \u2014 for synthesis that is usually the model provider, and the degraded path is to start the consultation without it rather than to wait."
